The source archive corresponding to this version is distributed alongside the
runtime as corresponding-source.tar.gz. It contains upstream build scripts,
Go module manifests, the source files, and upstream license information.
No changes were made to Mihomo's source. The upstream executable is renamed for
the application's resource/native-library packaging layout; the desktop package
builder may add the platform code signature required by the application bundle.

The application starts this runtime only for its own software update requests.
It does not install a VPN profile or change the device's system proxy settings.
